This was run both with a bug where if all columns were already cached the
program would attempt to still fetch an empty set of columns and then read the
local file from disk, merge the empty read, and then write it back, adding a
significant amount of overhead. 

Also the 2nd medium query ran in like 0.25 seconds which is such a narrow
timeframe to be ablet o measure percent runtime difference and distinguish it
from noise.
